# API layer

Keep `/api/v1` as a thin authenticated adapter over `Store`. Mutating requests require bearer authentication when configured and a caller-provided idempotency key. Return a receipt for accepted commands, not a predicted execution result. Keep error shape and HTTP status mapping documented in `docs/api-v1.md`, and add API tests for every route or authorization change.
